Delay 66 ms
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 2995 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 74 ms
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 3926 ms
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 71 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 2723 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 239 ms
RightUp 1
GoWhile 1 10</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>World of Warcraft</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>